      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>Extension of Remarks of Hon. Thomas J. Lane of Massachusetts in the House of Representatives, Tuesday, April 14, 1959.</tei:p>
        <tei:p>Mr. LANE. Mr. Speaker, under leave to extend my remarks in the RECORD, I wish to include the prayer of Rabbi Joseph Rudavsky, of Lawrence, at the opening session of the Massachusetts Senate on March 24, 1959, who was the guest of Senator William X. Wall, Lawrence. Mass.</tei:p>
        <tei:p>The following prayer was offered by Joseph Rudovsky of Lawrence:</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
