      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This prayer offered by Rabbi Joseph Rudavsky as an opening prayer for the Massachusetts Senate was added to the Congressional Record of the United States House of Representatives by Rep. Thomas Lane (MA 7- D) on 14 April 1959.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
